Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:04.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}What if every human got a random superpower overnight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:05.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:07.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your hands feel warm… too warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.90,0:00:08.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:12.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Over eight billion people get a power at the exact same second.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:14.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your neighbor floats above the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:16.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}A child makes the streetlights flicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:18.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Some powers are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.40,0:00:21.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Others are useless… like glowing in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:23.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}And nobody can control them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:24.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Traffic stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:26.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Nobody knows who is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:28.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}But here's the twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.10,0:00:30.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Some humans already have something like superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.90,0:00:38.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The Bajau sea nomads have spleens about fifty percent bigger than nearby non-divers, which may help them stay underwater longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:42.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}A rare change in a single gene means some people feel no pain at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.60,0:00:45.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}And some women have a fourth type of color cone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.20,0:00:47.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}A few may see colors we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:48.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}So remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.90,0:00:51.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Superpowers might already be hiding in our genes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.70,0:00:53.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Which one would you want?
